~ topic #[就 jiu4]

structure $topic
main-trl to only have

p As a <strong>verb</strong>, it means "to only have".

examples

example #1[我 wǒ] #2[在 zài] #3[上海 shānghǎi] #4[$topic] #5[两个 "èr ge"] #5[朋友 péngyou] 。
trl *1[I] *4[only have] *5[two] *6[friends] *2[in] *3[Shanghai].

end examples

p As an <strong>adverb</strong>, it emphasizes earliness of action.

examples

example #1[他 tā] #2[$topic] #3[来 lái] 。
trl *1[He] *3[will come] *2[right away].

example #1[他 tā] #2[明天 míngtiān] #3[七点 "qi1 dian3"] #4[$topic] #6[得 děi] #7[上课 "shàng kè"] 。
trl *1[He] *6[has to] *7[go to class] at *4[(as early as)] *3[7:00 AM] *2[tomorrow].

example #1[他 tā] #2[早在 zǎozài] #3[一九四二年 "yījiǔsìèr nian2"] #2[$topic] #4[成 chéng] #5[电影名星 "diànyǐng míngxīng"] #[了 le] 。
trl *1[He] *4[had become] *5[a movie star] *2[as early as] *3[1942].

end examples